            "sort": 2,
            "name": "Overview",
            "value": "<p>Overall, all three cities experienced population growth between 1990 and 2000, with the actual figures surpassing the predictions in every case. Additionally, Sao Paulo remained the most populous city throughout the period, while Jakarta was consistently the smallest.</p>",
